{"id":"n62375-1-4","stage":1,"title":"찌다 · 发胖","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62375-1-4-1","ko":"못 본 사이에 살이 많이 쪘구나?","zh":"这阵子没见，胖了不少啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"사이에","meaning":"间，之间，……的时候","explanation":"사이：间，之间，……的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"2","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이에","audio":"/audio/088d82d3555d167bc296.mp3"}},{"text":"살이","meaning":"肉","explanation":"살：肉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"쪘구나?","meaning":"发胖，长膘","explanation":"찌다：发胖，长膘；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"찌다","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62375","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쪘구나","audio":"/audio/f9b10994b50735720943.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，……的时候","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从某一时刻到另一个时刻的时间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"人或动物的身体中包裹着骨头的柔软部分。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"22c11459d6526bb8","term":"찌다","zh":"发胖，长膘","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3","entryId":"62375","definition":"身上长肉变胖。","pronunciation":["찌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ece6f35da1ccafcd2edc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62375-1-4-2","ko":"운동을 안 했더니 이렇게 몸이 확 불어났어.","zh":"没运动，体重一下就涨上去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했더니","audio":"/audio/bda5287494be17f016ed.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"확","meaning":"忽然","explanation":"확：忽然","readings":[{"term":"확","audio":"/audio/5d50ffa89558814b8525.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87313","senseId":"1","lemma":"확","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확","audio":"/audio/5d50ffa89558814b8525.mp3"}},{"text":"불어났어.","meaning":"上涨，膨胀","explanation":"불어나다：上涨，膨胀；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"불어나다","audio":"/audio/8931f4de2cfd9b448da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60400","senseId":"2","lemma":"불어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불어났어","audio":"/audio/9b1d5f9097d19e45ed3c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"5d50ffa89558814b","term":"확","zh":"忽然","audio":"/audio/5d50ffa89558814b8525.mp3","entryId":"87313","definition":"风、气味、劲头等突然猛烈袭来的样子。","pronunciation":["확"]},{"id":"8931f4de2cfd9b44","term":"불어나다","zh":"上涨，膨胀","audio":"/audio/8931f4de2cfd9b448da2.mp3","entryId":"60400","definition":"个头等变大。","pronunciation":["부러나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6188f1515e4e645fc6c5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62375","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.3614,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没运动，体重一下就涨上去了。","别给孩子们太大压力啊。","这阵子没见，胖了不少啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没运动，体重一下就涨上去了。","这阵子没见，胖了不少啊？","别给孩子们太大压力啊。"],"answer":0}]}
